      "code_snippet": "com.google.common.collect.Multimap<String, Object> queryParams1 = com.google.common.collect.ArrayListMultimap.create(); queryParams1.put(\"code\", pricing_admin_owner); context.streamDataFromDB(\"xpricing_admin_owner\", \"byPricingAdminOwnerCode\", queryParams1, record -> { ownerIdHolder[0] = Integer.parseInt(String.valueOf(record.get(\"id\"))); });",
      "purpose": "Resolve the unique compliance database surrogate ID corresponding to the administrator code provided in requests."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "type": "DATABASE_STREAM",
      "target_entity": "part_noun_name_ecc_xref",
